# EDITOR WIDGET LOCKS

All Article Editor widgets are frozen **except SEO**, which remains
intentionally unlocked for active development.

Manifest (`addons/content/editor-widget-locks.json`) is the single source
of truth. Typical state:

- `seo` — **UNLOCKED** (active development)
- all other registered Editor widgets — **LOCKED**
  (featured, images, gallery, reviews, links, cta, vocabulary, faq,
  ai-chat, publishing, status, …)

Before editing Editor code, check:

`addons/content/editor-widget-locks.json` (omnichannel-addons: `content/editor-widget-locks.json`)

Do not refactor, rename, localize, clean up, or indirectly modify
locked widget behavior.

"status" currently displays "Trạng thái".
Its missing locale is known and intentionally frozen.

Unlock only the specific widget id via:

`npm run widget-lock -- unlock <id>`

Then re-lock + seal after intentional work:

`npm run widget-lock -- lock <id>`

SEO can later be locked with `npm run widget-lock -- lock seo`.

Run `npm run check:editor-widget-locks` before finishing Editor tasks.
